Subject: [PATCH] TVP: admit upstream AsyncTrigger on the Android worker queue

Compile the original AsyncTrigger implementation and binding while the
Android session owns event delivery. Track live trigger owners for bounded
shutdown and break action cycles; validate the three supported event modes.
The generated build copy is patched; the pinned source remains unchanged.

Tested-by: tests/test_krkr_tjs2_source_admission.py focused git-apply unittest; forced Android CMake configure; cached/cancelled/reentrant trigger and shutdown instrumentation

--- a/src/core/base/EventIntf.cpp
+++ b/src/core/base/EventIntf.cpp
@@ -8,6 +8,11 @@
 //---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 // Script/Window Event Handling and Dispatching / System Idle Event Delivering
 //---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+#ifdef TWINQUILL_ANDROID_BASIC_TVP
+#include "tjsCommHead.h"
+#include "EventIntf.h"
+#include "krkr_tvp_events.h"
+#else
 #include "tjsCommHead.h"

 #include <algorithm>
